# Media that only the README needs, kept out of the published archive.
#
# pub.dev does not read README images from the archive: it rewrites every <img>
# through external-images.pub.dev to the raw GitHub URL, so these files have to
# be on main and do not have to be in the tarball. Excluding them takes the
# archive from 523 KB to roughly 130 KB.
#
# Two files deliberately stay: doc/bench.png and doc/platform.png are named by
# `screenshots:` in pubspec.yaml, and those ARE served from the archive. Listing
# either here would make publishing fail.
#
# This file shadows a .gitignore in this same directory. There is none here, so
# nothing is lost; do not move these rules to the repository root, where they
# would shadow the real .gitignore.
banner.png
layout.png
quantization.png
quantization.json
